%N A114886 Indices n >= 1 for which M_n < M_(n-1), where M_n is the maximum of abs(xi(1/2 + i*t)) on [t_n,t_(n+1)].
%C A114886 Here t_n is the n-th positive zero height of the Riemann zeta function and t_0 = 0; xi is the Riemann xi-function. - _Eric W. Weisstein_, Oct 10 2026
%H A114886 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/LehmersPhenomenon.html">Lehmer's Phenomenon</a>.
